{"id":"3E","title":"Lying","part":{"n":3,"title":"Relationship to Other Persons"},"url":"/law/03-relationship-to-other-persons/3e","entries":[{"id":"3E.1","text":"You shall not lie to one another.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":19,"verses":"11"},{"book":"Zephaniah","chapter":3,"verses":"13"},{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":4,"verses":"25"},{"book":"Colossians","chapter":3,"verses":"9"}],"citation":"Lev. 19:11; Zeph. 13:3; Eph. 4:25; Col. 3:9."},{"id":"3E.2","text":"Lying is iniquity and an abomination to God.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":6,"verses":"16-17,19"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":12,"verses":"22"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":59,"verses":"2-4"}],"citation":"Prov. 6:16-17, 19; Prov. 12:22; Isa. 59:2-4."},{"id":"3E.3","text":"We should pray to be delivered from lying lips that speak contemptuously against the righteous.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":31,"verses":"18"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":120,"verses":"2"}],"citation":"Psa. 31:18; Psa. 120:2."},{"id":"3E.4","text":"The righteous should hate and avoid lying.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":13,"verses":"5"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":119,"verses":"163"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":13,"verses":"5"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":63,"verses":"8"},{"book":"Zephaniah","chapter":3,"verses":"13"}],"citation":"Psa. 13:5; Psa. 119:163; Prov. 13:5; Isa. 63:8; Zeph. 3:13."},{"id":"3E.5","text":"Acquiring treasures by lying is the fleeting fantasy of those who seek death.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":21,"verses":"6"}],"citation":"Prov. 21:6."},{"id":"3E.6","text":"Should not respect or keep company with those that lie.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":40,"verses":"4"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":101,"verses":"7"}],"citation":"Psa. 40:4; Psa. 101:7."},{"id":"3E.7","text":"It is better to be a poor man than a liar.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":19,"verses":"22"}],"citation":"Prov. 19:22."},{"id":"3E.8","text":"Lying is a sign of apostasy.","refs":[{"book":"2 Thessalonians","chapter":2,"verses":"9"},{"book":"1 Timothy","chapter":4,"verses":"1-2"}],"citation":"2 Thes. 2:9; 1 Tim. 4:1-2."},{"id":"3E.9","text":"A lie lasts for but a moment, but truth shall be established forever.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":12,"verses":"19"}],"citation":"Prov. 12:19."},{"id":"3E.10","text":"Lying is an inherent attribute of the wicked.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":58,"verses":"3"}],"citation":"Psa. 58:3."},{"id":"3E.11","text":"Punishment and judgment for lying.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":5,"verses":"6"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":63,"verses":"11"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":120,"verses":"3-4"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":19,"verses":"5,9"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":50,"verses":"36"},{"book":"Revelation","chapter":21,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"Psa. 5:6; Psa. 63:11; Psa. 120:3-4; Prov. 19:5, 9; Jer. 50:36; Rev. 21:8."}]}